12. PROJECT CARD INTERACTION

When hovering over a project:

Image scales 102%–103%
Blue accent appears
Project number shifts slightly
"View case study →" appears
Cursor changes to "VIEW"
Description becomes slightly more prominent

Do not use exaggerated animations.

The interaction should feel polished.

13. PROJECT VISUAL HIERARCHY

For every project, make the visual larger than the text.

The visitor should first see:

What did he build?

Then:

Why did he build it?

Then:

How did he build it?

Avoid making the page feel text-heavy.

14. ADD CASE STUDY PREVIEW

Under each project add a small process indicator:

Problem

→

Approach

→

Build

→

Result

This lets visitors understand that clicking the project will reveal the complete story.

