17. ADD A "HOW I WORK" SECTION

Create a section after Skills:

How I work

Use four principles:

01 — Understand

Start with the problem rather than the technology.

02 — Explore

Try different approaches before committing.

03 — Build

Turn the selected idea into a working system.

04 — Iterate

Test, identify problems and improve.

Display these as four large editorial blocks.

Add subtle connecting lines.

This directly reinforces the portfolio's UX case-study philosophy.

